From 8422d676fd548eee2b407ec57e57c6d9ebd1091f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evgeniy Yelagin <evgeniy@kolibr.io>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 18:03:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add TPU transaction proxy for forwarding non-vote
 transactions via UDP

Adds the ability to proxy all incoming non-vote TPU QUIC transactions
to one or more external services via UDP. Proxy targets can be configured
at startup via --tpu-proxy-address and hot-reloaded at runtime via the
admin RPC command set-tpu-proxy-addresses.

Core proxy logic is isolated in proxy/tpu_transaction_proxy.rs to
minimize changes to existing files.

